    "updated_at": "2022-06-14T14:14:55Z",
    "body": "The statement is true, technically, because there's no new token emitted for the reconstructed `a` element.\r\n\r\nStill, the difference between `xmp` and `plaintext` is a bit perplexing, and I doubt this is intentional.",
