    "created_at": "2024-08-02T01:19:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-08-02T01:19:30Z",
    "body": "I'm also confused, trying to find the instruction to reconstruct the active formatting elements, but I can't find any. Yet, Safari, Chrome, and Firefox all do this.\r\n\r\nCan we confirm that this is an error in the spec document? Should the spec instruct to reconstruct the active formatting elements when encountering a start tag whose tag name is \"plaintext\" in the \"in body\" insertion mode?\r\n\r\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
