    "created_at": "2024-08-02T07:58:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-08-02T07:58:27Z",
    "body": "#10540 would change the tree from:\r\n\r\n- `p`\r\n  - `a`\r\n- `plaintext`\r\n  - `a`\r\n    - `#text`\r\n\r\nto:\r\n\r\n- `p`\r\n  - `a`\r\n- `a`\r\n  - `plaintext`\r\n    - `#text`\r\n\r\nCompare  https://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/12954 and  https://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/12955\r\n\r\nThe part of the spec that reconstructs in the `plaintext` example is the character token, see https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#parsing-main-inbody \"Any other character token\"",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
