    "created_at": "2024-08-02T08:04:28Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-08-02T08:04:28Z",
    "body": "Note also that the reconstruction would happen by the treebuilder even if the tokenizer is in the PLAINTEXT state.\r\n\r\nOptions:\r\n\r\n1. Leave the spec as-is. There is no error, and no stated plans to change behavior.\r\n2. Clarify in a note that elements can still be inserted into a `plaintext` element by the parser if the list of active formatting elements is not empty.\r\n3. Change the parsed tree to be consistent with `xmp` (i.e. #10540).\r\n\r\nFor (3), implementers need to be convinced that it's a worthwhile change.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
